      "extract": "[]{#pre label=\"pre\"} Let $K$ be a field, $K\\langle X\\rangle$ be the non-commutative polynomial algebra generated by $X$ where $X=\\{x_1,...,x_n\\}$ is a finite set. Let $X^*=\\{u|u=x_{i_1}\\cdots x_{i_m},m\\ge 0, i_1,\\cdots,i_m \\in \\{1,\\cdots,n\\}\\}$ be the monoid generated by $X$, and define the identity by the empty word which is denoted by $1$. Denote the degree of a word $w\\in X^*$ by $|w|$. ::: definition A total",
